WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.312
ArborKnowledge Studio makes
professional knowledge traceable,
from the source onward.

00:00:05.862 --> 00:00:09.450
A fictional case becomes a set of
knowledge units.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:13.230
Each one links back to the precise
place it came from.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.030
Only a human reviewer can approve a
chapter.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:21.947
That approval is an editorial
decision, not a professional
certification.

00:00:22.498 --> 00:00:28.197
Before learning begins, the coverage
view shows what is supported and
what still needs evidence.

00:00:28.748 --> 00:00:33.222
Redion Cekrezi, full stack and
applied AI developer.

00:00:33.352 --> 00:00:35.502
Upgrade humans.

00:00:35.632 --> 00:00:37.620
Not replace them.
